  Bounty Hunter,1,"A thematic category printed under the card art. Carried by 400 printings of 93 distinct cards; named in the ability text of 12 distinct card(s) (exact-word match, so it can include non-trait uses of the word). No rules meaning of its own: it matters only where another card refers to it.","04010001"
